        "id": 2822702110,
        "content": "maybe we should also handle `AggregateError` inside the SDK to have this functionality everywhere\n_Originally posted by @whilefoo in https://github.com/ubiquity-os-marketplace/command-start-stop/pull/133#discussion_r1936395440_\nMultiple aggregated errors do not get displayed properly by the SDK using `postComment`, because it is an array of errors instead of a single error with a single message. Error messages should get concatenated altogether.",
